'''Muddy Fjord''' is the fourth stage in [[Cats Cradle Basin]]. This stage is a remake of the [[Moon (Into the Future)|Moon]] from [[Into the Future]] Chapter 2. [[Corrupted Valkyrie]] and [[Devil Wife]] make their first appearances in [[Zero Legends]] here.

